job-description-iaa = You are a servant of the people; defend and prosecute the citizens of your station!
job-description-magistrat = You are the very embodiment of station justice; your duty is to judge all major violators of the peace.
job-description-centcomop = Do not authorize evacuation. Do not authorize ERT deployment. Divide the station crew's payroll by zero.
job-description-senior-engineer = Instruct new engineers in the fundamentals of engine operation, repairs, atmospheric systems, and the complex's power supply.
job-description-senior-researcher = Instruct new scientists in the basics of item fabrication, artifact analysis, and the study of anomalous objects.
job-description-senior-physician = Instruct new medics in the fundamentals of patient care, chemistry, diagnostics, and the proper disposal of the deceased.
job-description-senior-officer = Instruct new cadets in the basics of searching suspects, making arrests, detention protocols, and proper firearm handling.
job-description-blueshield-officer = Your primary duty is to protect the Heads of Staff. Remember: you are not a standard Security Officer.
job-description-blueshield-ensign = Your primary duty is to command the forces of the "Blue Shield" Special Operations Unit.
job-description-blueshield-operative = Your primary duty is to execute missions involving the protection of high-value individuals.
job-description-roboticist = Focus on the creation of cyborgs and mechs, and perform their maintenance.
job-description-mail-carrier = Deliver the letter to its intended recipient... at any cost!
job-description-head-of-prison = Manage the finest establishment on the planet.
job-description-planet-prisoner = Well, basically, you're a convict.
job-description-prison-inspector = Document violations and maintain order within the prison facility.
job-description-prison-chef = Prepare meals for both the inmates and the prison staff. job-description-prison-doctor = Treat injured prisoners.
job-description-prison-engineer = Ensure the prison remains operational.
job-description-prison-scientist = Research new technologies for the prison.
job-description-prison-pilot = Transport prisoners to the facility in your shuttle.
job-description-prison-worker = Perform the jobs that no one else wants to do.
job-description-prison-guard = Keep an eye on the prisoners.
job-description-prison-trainee = Train under experienced guards and help maintain order in the prison.
job-description-security-pilot = Assault the Syndicate base in your shuttle—if you can find it, that is.
job-description-ntrep = You are an auditor sent by Central Command to ensure that all personnel are working efficiently and in the corporation's best interests.
job-description-medical-borg = Adhere to your laws, serve the crew, and pester the scientists for upgrades.
job-description-engineer-borg = Adhere to your laws, serve the crew, and pester the scientists for upgrades.
job-description-miner-borg = Adhere to your laws, serve the crew, and pester the scientists for upgrades.
job-description-janitor-borg = Adhere to your laws, serve the crew, and pester the scientists for upgrades.
job-description-service-borg = Adhere to your laws, serve the crew, and pester the scientists for upgrades.
job-description-clown-borg = Adhere to your laws, serve the crew, and pester the scientists for upgrades.
job-description-peace-borg = Adhere to your laws, serve the crew, and pester the scientists for upgrades. job-description-sec-borg = Adhere to your Laws, serve the crew, and pester Scientists with requests for upgrades.
job-description-sec-combat-borg = Adhere to your Laws, serve the crew, and pester Scientists with requests for upgrades.
job-description-adjutant = Act as an informant for the Command Staff and personal assistant to the Captain; coordinate departmental operations and assist with bureaucratic tasks.
job-description-barber = You are responsible for the hairstyles of the facility's personnel.
job-description-pathologist = A medical professional responsible for transporting bodies to the morgue and performing both ante-mortem and post-mortem diagnostics.
job-description-usspcrew = Perform your duties for the Motherland.
job-description-usspguard = You are a servant of the people; protect and watch over the citizens of your station!
job-description-usspsoldier = Your primary objective is territorial defense and the execution of orders. The Motherland calls!
job-description-usspcaptain = Command the finest place in the cosmos. The Motherland calls!
job-description-ntrg = You serve as the pillar and shield of the Legal Department, enforcing the rulings and decrees of the Magistrate himself and the NanoTrasen Representative!
job-description-ntrofficer = You serve as the pillar and shield of the Legal Department, enforcing the rulings and decrees of the Magistrate himself and the NanoTrasen Representative!
job-description-miningspec = Stay station-side and enrich the station with materials using your salvage magnet and ore processors.
job-description-commaid = A specially trained maid designated for the priority cleaning of Command areas.
